#
# D-0190/D-0191: the first product surface that spends a capability token and changes a real
# file. Phase 1's seven backbone steps existed as separate, tested mechanisms with nothing
# reachable from a request; this is the seam, not a new mechanism.
#
# What this image adds: `services/reference-control-plane/src/workspace-actions.mjs` and
# three-plus routes (`GET/POST /api/v1/workspace-actions[...]`) gated behind `workspace.write`.
# The trivial risk path only (11_REVISIONE_E_CORREZIONI.md P6): one step, WRITE only, files
# supplied by the caller. A plan is proposed, a human approves or rejects it, and approval
# either promotes cleanly to the real workspace — through the existing capability/shadow/
# executor chain, unmodified — or changes nothing at all. Diff before/after, one-time restore,
# every step in the causal event ledger (step 6, wired to something for the first time).
#
# Deliberately NOT built here, and workspaceActionsStatus() says so: DELETE, EXECUTE, and any
# execution of an AI-declared test. executor.mjs refuses EXECUTE permanently and on purpose —
# reopening it to run a plan-declared command would be arbitrary code execution wearing the
# shape of this phase's wiring, not this phase's job.
#
# D-0192, found building: the first wiring pointed the shadow root at `workspace/shadows`,
# nested inside the tree it shadows. shadow.mjs already refuses that for a real whole-workspace
# shadow ("the shadow and the workspace must not contain one another") — the read-only
# /api/v1/shadow status route uses the same directory but only ever probes a tiny file there,
# so the refusal never fired until this wiring tried to build a real one. Fixed: the shadow
# root is /tmp (the container's other writable location, never nested in /workspace), and the
# orchestrator now refuses at construction if the two ever nest again, rather than failing five
# frames deep in shadow.mjs on the first live approval.
#
# Only `services/reference-control-plane/src/` changed. Nothing else in the image is
# rebuilt or re-copied — an unchanged layer proves nothing and costs one anyway.
#
# Built with --network=none --pull=false.
FROM noesar-evolution:phase4-repomap

USER root
COPY --chown=10001:10001 services/reference-control-plane/src/ /opt/noesar/services/reference-control-plane/src/
USER 10001:10001
